&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio is an innovative-driven company that’s dramatically transformed itself over the past 18 months and we’re seeking a&lt;strong&gt; CEO Communications Director&lt;/strong&gt; to help support its CEO. In this highly visible, fast-paced, and strategic role, you will help shape and manage the CEO&#39;s external communications, building a high-impact narrative that elevates his voice across global stages, key industry moments, and digital channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within Twilio’s Corporate Communications team, which is responsible for shaping and delivering Twilio’s story to media, customers, industry analysts, and employees. You will collaborate closely with partners across Product Marketing, Investor Relations, Legal, Brand, and Corporate Communications to align the CEO’s external communications with our overarching business strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the development of high-impact executive messaging for the CEO across key milestones, including quarterly earnings, corporate announcements, company milestones, and strategic business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with PR and social media teams to conceptualize and execute a compelling thought leadership program. This includes ghostwriting long-form narratives and bylines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Media Relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead proactive media outreach, crafting pitches and securing high-profile placements, feature profiles, and speaking opportunities that align with Twilio&#39;s corporate narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own CEO Social Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct, manage, and continuously grow the CEO&#39;s LinkedIn presence, ensuring a consistent, engaging, and authentic digital footprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a bridge across the business, working in lockstep with the CEO and other key teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
