&lt;p&gt;Twilio is experiencing significant growth, and we are seeking a dynamic and results-oriented Digital Marketing Manager to drive demand creation and acceleration for Twilio&#39;s CPaaS portfolio. Reporting to the Digital Marketing Director of APJ, &amp;nbsp;you will be instrumental in designing and implementing the digital strategy focused on building pipelines across direct sales and self-serve motions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In collaboration with Campaign Management, Product Marketing and Sub-Regional Field Marketing teams, orchestrate the effective channel mix to amplify regional campaigns and targeted programs to generate quality demand, deepen engagements and drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
