&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio’s Self-Service Business, serves more than 300,000 active customers and generates nearly $1B annually. This position is needed to grow and retain high-value self-service accounts by engaging customers at the right moment, guiding product adoption, preventing churn, and helping customers reach scale across Twilio Communications, SendGrid, or Segment products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage high-value self-service customers through programmatically assigned inbound and outbound leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities by assessing product usage signals, customer needs, and readiness to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through adoption of Twilio Communications, SendGrid, or Segment products to accelerate business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retain priority accounts by proactively addressing risks, removing blockers, and supporting continued product value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Solutions Engineering, Marketing, and Product teams to improve sales plays and customer engagement strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 1 year of sales development or business development experience at a technology company, or 2-3+ years of closing experience in another industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to qualify inbound and outbound opportunities, uncover customer needs, and guide customers toward relevant solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to engage technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using data, product usage signals, and sales plays to prioritize outreach and identify growth or retention opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage a high-volume book of accounts, prioritize effectively, and follow through on customer commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about cloud communications, customer engagement, email, data, or SaaS products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling SaaS, cloud communications, email, customer data, or developer-focused products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with product-led growth, self-service customer motions, or usage-based sales models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret customer usage trends and translate insights into relevant sales conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Salesforce, Outreach, Gong, or similar sales engagement and CRM tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in helping customers adopt and scale solutions across Twilio Communications, SendGrid, or Segment products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
