&lt;p&gt;Twilio is seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Director, Supplier Relations&lt;/strong&gt; to execute our supply strategy, manage regional vendor and carrier partnerships, and lead a team of supplier relations specialists across Asia-Pacific (APAC). In this role, you will translate regional connectivity strategy into operational execution, optimizing COGS, route quality, and direct supplier partnerships. Working closely with cross-functional partners in Sales, Product, Legal, and Operations, you will ensure Twilio&#39;s infrastructure reliably aligns with rapid enterprise growth across diverse APAC markets.&lt;/p&gt;
