&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of APAC telecommunications ecosystems, messaging aggregators, and regional market dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of negotiating commercial supplier agreements and driving unit economics (COGS) optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with Sales, Product, and Operations to translate revenue demand into supplier capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience leveraging performance metrics and data tools for route optimization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
