&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Telecommunications, Business, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical understanding of core communications protocols and standards (e.g., SMPP, SIP, REST APIs, A2P/P2P messaging).&lt;/li&gt;
