&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we expand our partner ecosystem to support global growth targets, we are expanding our team to scale responsibly. We are seeking a versatile &lt;strong&gt;Partner Program Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to drive an exceptional experience across our Systems Integrators (SIs), ISVs, Resell, and Technology partners. This balanced role bridges the gap between high-touch partner experience, strategic cross-functional project management, and advanced lifecycle automation. If you have a deep background in partnerships, an AI-forward mindset for process optimization, and hands-on experience with modern ecosystem toolsets, this role offers an exciting opportunity to shape the future of our global network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just follow a static blueprint—you will help build it. We are seeking a highly proactive partner program manager to drive exceptional experiences for our Systems Integrators (SIs), ISVs, Resell, and Technology partners. You will take the lead on optimizing the end-to-end partner journey, managing cross-functional projects, and eliminating operational friction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires a &quot;can-do&quot; attitude and a passion for continuous improvement. You will be responsible for transforming manual workflows into automated, scalable systems, managing key vendor capabilities, and implementing strategic initiatives that directly unlock ecosystem revenue velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Program Modernization &amp;amp; Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an operational engine for the team, identifying process bottlenecks and proactively designing new ways to automate existing manual workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Step into complex challenges across the partner lifecycle and chart a clear path forward to build repeatable, programmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize the Partner Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and refine core partner onboarding pathways, lifecycle touchpoints, and support workflows to deliver a seamless, world-class journey for external ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Partner Revenue Mechanics:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and execute operational frameworks that eliminate transaction friction, streamline incentive administration, and maximize partner-sourced revenue pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Technology &amp;amp; Vendor Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a strategic owner for key components of our partner tech stack and vendor relationships, ensuring our data models and tools are optimized for ecosystem scale rather than mere maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate High-Touch Communications:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute comprehensive partner engagement strategies, ensuring clear, accessible program documentation, impactful updates, and consistent enablement communications across all segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Cross-Functional Project Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and run end-to-end project plans for new partner initiatives, collaborating closely with Product, Marketing, Sales, Legal, and Tech teams to ensure alignment and timely milestone delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
