&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Principal Product Manager to own and lead strategic email data plane integrations strategy. You’ll navigate complex infrastructure challenges with demonstrable technical acumen while actively partnering with key external and internal partners. By transforming ambiguity into resilient, scalable systems, you’ll protect vital revenue streams and lay the groundwork for the future growth. Join us to define the next chapter of email at Twilio.&lt;/p&gt;
