&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years experience in product management, with 5+ years in the email domain. You are known as an expert, with a proven track record of outcomes, and shaping the strategy of communication products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work backwards from customer needs, crystallizing problems that translate into impactful product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how B2B and large enterprises operate, including sales cycles and organizational dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
