&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of leadership experience managing developer relations, technical evangelism, or community advocacy programs (and 10+ years total working in this technical field).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building, training, and scaling outstanding technical global teams to support local and global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical baseline with an understanding of software developer personas and workflows (e.g., former full-time developer or hands-on software development experience).&lt;/li&gt;
