&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end strategy, content localization, speaker sourcing, venue management, and execution for proprietary Twilio regional events across key DACH tech hubs (e.g., Munich, Berlin, Zurich, Frankfurt).&lt;/li&gt;
