&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;In this role, you will develop data-driven co-marketing plans with strategic partners, build scalable demand-generation programs, and align internal sales teams with external partner leadership. You will serve as the strategic bridge driving co-selling motions, managing operational budgets, enforcing lead governance, and tracking partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline growth across the enterprise cloud and SaaS ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Responsibilities In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
