&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop&lt;/strong&gt; data-driven multi-quarter co-marketing plans and joint GTM strategies with strategic partners to hit regional pipeline targets.&lt;/p&gt;
