&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execute&lt;/strong&gt; targeted account-mapping using platforms like Crossbeam to drive custom 1:1 ABM campaigns for elite partners and scalable digital toolkits for broader partner networks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Co-create&lt;/strong&gt; compelling &quot;better together&quot; messaging, solution briefs, and branded assets with Product Marketing to showcase joint value propositions.&lt;/p&gt;
