&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deliver&lt;/strong&gt; turn-key, through-partner demand-generation programs and drive partner adoption of the Twilio Partner Portal for self-service execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
