&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Equip&lt;/strong&gt; partner sales and BDR teams with custom outreach playbooks, script templates, and email sequences to ensure rapid campaign follow-up.&lt;/p&gt;
