&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage&lt;/strong&gt; partner marketing operational budgets, ensuring fiscal compliance and optimal ROI across co-marketing investments.&lt;/p&gt;
