&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to design and deliver high-impact talent development experiences for Twilions globally, driving skills development and enabling professional excellence. Acting as a strategic thought partner and program lead for flagship development initiatives, you will be a key leader in the evaluation, design, and execution of learning content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Senior Director of Talent Development, you will support the continued growth of Twilions by architecting and optimizing existing programming while evaluating new tools to empower learning teams across the organization. The ideal candidate operates at a strategic level while staying deeply involved in the details of day-to-day development optimization to enhance employee engagement and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, lead, and evolve high-visibility talent development programs that drive continuous growth and professional excellence for all Twilions globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic advisor to HRBPs and senior leaders, establishing an organization-wide mandate to assess capability gaps and deploy targeted learning solutions globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end lifecycle of flagship development initiatives—from needs assessment and instructional design to global facilitation, impact measurement, and continuous iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and champion a global learning strategy, collaborating with stakeholders to systematically close critical skill gaps across all business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply expert-level knowledge of modern learning science and AI-driven tools to architect scalable development experiences that resonate across a diverse, global workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize global engagement and participation in talent development initiatives through compelling communications, recognition, and robust support for internal career mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
