&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Cloud Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with cloud environments, including basic exposure to account management, IAM permissions, or core services in at least one major provider—&lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., IAM, Organizations, SSO/Identity Center), &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Azure&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Microsoft Entra ID/Azure AD, RBAC, Subscriptions), or &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Cloud IAM, Workload Identity, Projects). General familiarity with multi-account/multi-project cloud architecture is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
