&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of cloud computing, cPaaS, AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional public speaking, storytelling, interpersonal, and consensus-building capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
