&lt;li&gt;Experiment and iterate on new product ideas, leveraging AI, machine learning, and emerging tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical direction, guiding and mentoring engineering teams throughout the development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to align prototypes with business opportunities and strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor a group of software development engineers across US and India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical vision and results clearly to stakeholders and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in architecture or principal engineering roles within innovative, fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applied fraud detection and governance framework experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI, machine learning, and LLMs with experience deploying models or AI-driven projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success designing large-scale, high-performance architectures across AWS &amp;amp; Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and mentoring skills, with proven ability to drive technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills for both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
