&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of product management experience building large scale cloud services platforms; specifically building cloud native commerce systems for usage-based and metered products at a very large scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of results including establishing ambitious goals, achieving /over-achieving those goals and taking overall responsibility for customer and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving companies through ground-breaking change with the ability to see the big-picture while also being hands-on in the details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with strong communication skills, and ability to communicate business value and product features/benefits and influence at the highest levels to drive change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven, outcomes oriented and a problem solver&lt;/li&gt;
