&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of experience in strategy, operations, management consulting, product, or growth roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to synthesize complex technical, operational, and financial data into concise written memos and executive presentations that drive rapid decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build relationships and drive alignment across Product, Sales, Operations, and Finance across individual contributors to VP levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to think critically and apply structured problem-solving techniques to unfamiliar challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in data analysis and visualization e.g., SQL, Looker, Tableau, Coefficient, Airtable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, prioritize tasks, and manage multiple projects in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
