&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Billing Supervisor to support end-to-end order processing, invoicing, and post-billing communications for sales teams and customers. In this role, you will work closely with Deal Operations, Revenue Accounting, Collections and Sales to ensure smooth contract execution and issue resolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will directly lead and support an operational team based in Mexico while collaborating cross-functionally with global counterparts across the United States, Ireland, and India.&lt;/p&gt;
