&lt;li&gt;Lead and supervise an international team of analysts and senior analysts handling post-billing communications, invoice portal processing, and issue remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee daily order management, billing, and communications to ensure timely invoicing, precise contract provisioning, and rapid issue remediation while holding the team accountable to key SLAs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an escalation point for billing, collections, and order management inquiries, delivering timely resolutions for both internal stakeholders and external customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate customer contracts across multiple internal systems to maintain data integrity and accurate financial reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and own SOX-compliant month-end reconciliations for billing and provisioning, ensuring full data completeness and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and fulfill audit deliverables for internal/external auditors and tax consultants during quarterly and annual reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
