&lt;li&gt;Ability to ramp up on new technologies, solution against well defined problems and to be iterative about building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for innovation and exploring emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in remote or globally distributed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
